    {
      "_id": "bcec3aa68dce3c85",
      "name": "The Chase",
      "type": "feature",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>When this Traversal starts, place a Chase Die (d8) on this card with the 4 value facing up. When a PC makes an action related to the chase, turn the die according to the result.</p><p>• When a PC succeeds with Hope, increase the die by 2.<br>• When a PC succeeds with Fear, increase the die by 1.<br>• When a PC fails with Hope, decrease the die by 1.<br>• When a PC fails with Fear, decrease the die by 2.</p><p>If the die reach the 8 value, the PC succeed in the Highway Kill Run, either by escaping or having reached the target. If the die reach 0, the PC failed, either getting captured or letting the target escape.</p><p>Why are we chasing them, anyway?</p>",
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "actions": {}
      },
